    "runtimePreservation": {
      "status": "passed",
      "notes": "Actual native Molen placement, four LODs and failed-load fallback checked. Only the overlapping longitudinal bridge corridor is suppressed while resident. Short outside bridge tails retain connected deck heights; the two directly connected streets receive local elevation hints with retaining side/end faces down to unchanged native ground. All 290 resident buildings and the horizontal geometry of 296 other road features remain; only the two connected street profiles intentionally change. Original source road inputs, every DEM sample, native river and native shoreline behavior remain. Model vertices retain the 40.05 m absolute datum. Failure retains the original full mapped crossing without inferred approach hints/supports. Unload restores native content and releases both model and support geometry."
